          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu abasigaire, abakuhani, Abalevita, abakumilizi, abahoyi, abakozi ba Rwensinga na bona abataishukaine n'abanyamahanga kukwata Amateka ga Ruhanga, abakazi babo, batabani babo na bahara babo, bona abaina amagezi n'obushobokerwa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bema na barumuna babo n'abami babo, barahira bati, “Turakwata Amateka ga Ruhanga waitu ag'omwiruwe Musa yataireho, tuhikye emihango yona y'Omukama waitu, n'emigenzo n'ebiragirobye; kitali kityo tufe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Titushwelerane na banyamahanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'abanyamahanga baraleta ebyashara anga emyaka yona yona aha kiro kya Sabato anga aha kiro kitakatifu ekindi titubibagureho. Omu mwaka gwa mushanju turaleka ensi eigare, n'amabanja gona titugatonge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
